libniji C library: configuration and programs
 libniji is an implementation of the GNU C Library's ABI (glibc $abi, x86-64).
 This package holds $programs, the loader configuration
 (/etc/ld.so.conf and /etc/ld.so.conf.d), /etc/gai.conf and the template of
 /etc/nsswitch.conf. The C library's other programs (locale, localedef) are not
 part of this build yet.
